msgid ""
"活动层喝水动作的按键时长，格式：a键时长-w键时长-d键时长\n"
"例：1.087-1.0-0.8；如果角色移动时被挡住，请微调各键时长"
msgstr ""
"Drink movement key durations: a duration-w duration-d duration\n"
"Example: 1.087-1.0-0.8; adjust each duration if the character gets stuck"

